&lt;p&gt;Most hiring flows start online. &lt;strong&gt;JSON Resume&lt;/strong&gt; lets you keep one structured &lt;code&gt;resume.json&lt;/code&gt; and render it as HTML, PDF, or data inside your own site. &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://antoineboucher.info/CV/blog/posts/professional-resume-json-resume/"&gt;Version française&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; covers the same walkthrough.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>